\b Book Recommendation System - Q/A Preparation\b0\par
\par
\b 1. Project Overview\b0\par
This project is a C++ OOP-based book recommendation system designed as a complete software project from scratch. It loads books, users, and ratings from CSV files, supports search and filtering, allows users to update preferences and rate books, and generates recommendations using a final hybrid recommendation logic.\par
\par
\b 2. Key Features\b0\par
1. Book browsing and search by title or author.\par
2. Genre and rating based filtering.\par
3. User registration, authentication, and preference management.\par
4. Book rating with rating updates reflected in book statistics.\par
5. Recommendation engine using one final hybrid recommendation flow.\par
\par
